    "--depth can't be negative" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "--depth 不能为负数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "--engine switches the virtualization engine without touching the disk or the installed system. For Windows, for example, use vz for everyday builds and tests (lowest overhead) and switch to qemu when you need sound or suspend.\nmacOS guests can only use vz.\n--retina applies only to QEMU VMs and Linux on VZ shown in the app's window. You can change it while the VM is running; it takes effect the next time an open window is resized.\n--clipboard syncs the text clipboard between the app's window and the guest (on by default). macOS and Windows guests sync through the agent, so you can change this while they run; Linux guests sync through spice-vdagent and must be shut down first.\n--screen-lock sets whether the guest locks its screen once it's idle and the display has gone to sleep (off by default). The guest agent applies it in the guest: right away if the VM is running, otherwise when the agent starts at the next boot. macOS guests need the guest password saved in the VM bundle.\n--disk-size only grows the system disk image; you need to expand the partition in the guest yourself, except for Linux from cloud images, which expands it automatically at the next boot.\n--network bridged puts the guest directly on the host's local network; turn on the network helper in the app's settings first. Without an interface name, it uses the first interface that can be bridged at boot.\n--remove-share runs before --add-share, so to make a shared folder read-only or writable, remove it and add it back. Shared folders work only with macOS and Linux guests on the VZ engine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "--engine 切换虚拟化引擎，不动磁盘和已装好的系统。例如 Windows：日常编译测试用 vz（开销最低），需要声音或挂起时换成 qemu。\nmacOS 客户机只能用 vz。\n--retina 只用于在 App 窗口里显示的 QEMU 虚拟机和 VZ 上的 Linux。虚拟机运行中也能修改，已打开的窗口在下次调整大小时生效。\n--clipboard 在 App 窗口与客户机之间同步文本剪贴板（默认开）。macOS 和 Windows 客户机经客户机代理同步，运行中也能修改；Linux 客户机经 spice-vdagent 同步，要先关机再修改。\n--screen-lock 设置客户机在空闲且显示器休眠后是否锁屏（默认关）。由客户机代理在客户机里应用：虚拟机运行中立即生效，否则在下次开机、代理启动时生效。macOS 客户机需要虚拟机包里保存了客户机密码。\n--disk-size 只扩大系统盘镜像，客户机里的分区要自己扩展；用云镜像创建的 Linux 例外，下次开机时会自动扩展。\n--network bridged 让客户机直接接入主机所在的局域网，要先在 App 的设置里启用网络辅助程序。不写网卡名时，开机时使用第一块可桥接的网卡。\n--remove-share 先于 --add-share 执行，所以要把共享目录改成只读或可写，先移除再加回即可。共享目录只用于 VZ 引擎上的 macOS 和 Linux 客户机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "--image and --desktop are only for Linux guests" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "--image 与 --desktop 只用于 Linux 客户机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
