            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 ~/.ssh/config 中加入一行 Include。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the guest starts, expand its root partition and file system, for example with the Disks app or with growpart and resize2fs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "客户机开机后，在里面扩展根分区和文件系统，例如用「磁盘」应用，或用 growpart 和 resize2fs。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the guest starts, open Disk Management in it and choose Extend Volume on drive C." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开机后在客户机的「磁盘管理」里对 C 盘选「扩展卷」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the virtual machine starts, use the graphical installer in its window to set up the account, language, and other options." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机开机后，在它的窗口里用图形安装程序设置账户、语言等选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent %@ · %@ · %@\nIPv4: %@\nMemory: %@ of %@ available\nUptime: %llu s" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Agent %1$@ · %2$@ · %3$@\nIPv4: %4$@\nMemory: %5$@ of %6$@ available\nUptime: %7$llu s"
