    "Asked the guest to shut down. Press Ctrl-C again to power off immediately." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已请求客户机关机。再按一次 Ctrl-C 立即强制断电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks the guest to shut down and waits for it. With --force, powers the VM off immediately, and any unsaved data is lost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请求客户机关机并等待关机完成。加 --force 会立即强制断电，未保存的数据都会丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
