      }
    },
    "Engine" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "引擎"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every command accepts --json and then prints a single line to standard output: {\"schemaVersion\":1,\"result\":…} on success, or {\"schemaVersion\":1,\"error\":{\"code\":…,\"message\":…}} on failure.\n\nExit codes:\n  0   Success\n  1   Other error\n%@\n  64  Command-line usage error\n\nYou can change the VM, downloads, and templates folders in the app's settings. The CLI reads the same file (~/Library/Application Support/MacVM/settings.json).\nMACVM_HOME, if set, overrides the VM folder from settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有命令都支持 --json，此时向标准输出打印一行：成功时为 {\"schemaVersion\":1,\"result\":…}，失败时为 {\"schemaVersion\":1,\"error\":{\"code\":…,\"message\":…}}。\n\n退出码：\n  0   成功\n  1   其他错误\n%@\n  64  命令行用法错误\n\n虚拟机、下载和模板目录可在 App 设置里更改，CLI 读取同一个文件（~/Library/Application Support/MacVM/settings.json）。\n设置了 MACVM_HOME 时，它优先于设置里的虚拟机目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File or socket I/O error" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件或 socket 读写失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finishing installation…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在完成安装…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example: enter, cmd+shift+t, ctrl+alt+delete. Modifiers are cmd (the Windows key on Windows, Super on Linux), ctrl, alt (option), and shift. The main key is a key name, or the character the key types without Shift, on a US keyboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "例如 enter、cmd+shift+t、ctrl+alt+delete。修饰键有 cmd（在 Windows 上是 Windows 键，在 Linux 上是 Super）、ctrl、alt（option）和 shift。主键写键名，或写美式键盘上不按 Shift 时这个键打出的字符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Force Power Off" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "强制断电"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GB" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "GB (uses space only as needed)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GB（按需占用空间）"
          }
        }
