    "ISO not found: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "找不到 ISO：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the agent is online, it replaces itself with the version bundled with the app; SSH isn't needed. Otherwise it's installed over SSH, which is also used when an auth token needs to be written, when the Windows 3D graphics driver needs to be copied into the guest, or when you pass --ssh." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "代理在线时，它会把自己换成 App 自带的版本，不需要 SSH。否则经 SSH 安装；需要写入认证令牌、要把 Windows 3D 显卡驱动拷进客户机，或指定了 --ssh 时，也会用 SSH。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Images appear as USB drives in the guest. Eject them in the guest before ejecting them here, or data the guest hasn't finished writing may be lost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "映像在客户机里显示为 U 盘。先在客户机里推出，再在这里推出，否则客户机还没写完的数据可能丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the guest, each shared folder appears under /Volumes/My Shared Files, named after its tag." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在客户机里，每个共享目录都出现在 /Volumes/My Shared Files 下，以它的名称命名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
