    },
    "Lock Screen When Idle" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "空闲后锁屏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lock the screen when the guest is idle: on or off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "客户机空闲后锁屏：on 或 off。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locks the guest screen when it's idle and the display sleeps, so a password is needed to get back in. When off, the guest never locks. Takes effect right away, even while running" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "客户机空闲且显示器休眠时锁定屏幕，回来要输入密码。关闭后客户机从不锁屏。运行中更改也立即生效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Login password for cloud images, automatically installed Ubuntu Desktop, and Windows, saved as guest-password in the VM bundle. If omitted, cloud images allow only SSH key login, and Ubuntu Desktop and Windows get a random password." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "云镜像、自动安装的 Ubuntu 桌面版与 Windows 的登录密码，保存为虚拟机包内的 guest-password。省略时，云镜像只能用 SSH 密钥登录，Ubuntu 桌面版与 Windows 则随机生成密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Login user to create for cloud images, automatically installed Ubuntu Desktop, and Windows (default: your host user name)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为云镜像、自动安装的 Ubuntu 桌面版与 Windows 创建的登录用户（默认与主机用户同名）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MacVM" : {
