        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On APFS nothing is actually copied, so cloning takes seconds. The clone gets a new machine identifier and MAC address, and if the VM was created from a cloud image, the clone is re-initialized with a new hostname." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 APFS 上不会真正复制数据，克隆只需几秒。克隆出的虚拟机会获得新的机器标识和 MAC 地址；如果原虚拟机由云镜像创建，克隆还会以新主机名重新初始化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On macOS, the recovery partition sits right after the system container, so the new space isn't added to the container. To use it, delete the recovery partition in the guest and grow the container with diskutil apfs resizeContainer. Recovery mode won't be available after that." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 的系统容器后面紧跟着恢复分区，新增的空间不会并入系统容器。要用上它，得在客户机里删除恢复分区后用 diskutil apfs resizeContainer 扩展系统容器，之后就进不了恢复模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One or more sources, then the destination directory." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个或多个来源，然后是目标目录。"
          }
        }
      }
