    },
    "Save a running VM's screen as a PNG (QEMU engine only)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把运行中虚拟机的画面存为 PNG（仅限 QEMU 引擎）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save a shut-down VM as a template, then create VMs from it with macvm create <name> --template <template>. Templates are stored in the templates folder, which you can change in the app's settings. On the same APFS volume nothing is actually copied. VMs created from a template get a new machine identifier and MAC address, and those from cloud images are re-initialized with a new hostname." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把已关机的虚拟机存为模板，再用 macvm create <名称> --template <模板> 从它新建。模板存在模板目录里，可在 App 设置里更改。在同一个 APFS 卷上不会真正复制数据。由模板新建的虚拟机会获得新的机器标识和 MAC 地址，由云镜像创建的还会以新主机名重新初始化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save a shut-down VM as a template, without its snapshots." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把已关机的虚拟机存为模板（不含快照）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
