          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snapshot Name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快照名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snapshot name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快照名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snapshot not found" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快照不存在"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snapshot not found: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快照不存在：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snapshots" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快照"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snapshots are APFS clones, so they only use space for data that changes afterward. A snapshot of a suspended VM includes its memory: after you restore it, the next start resumes right where it left off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快照是 APFS 克隆，只为之后改动的数据占用空间。给挂起的虚拟机做快照时会连同内存一起保存，还原后下次开机会从上次停下的地方继续运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snapshots aren't included in the template. You can create new virtual machines from it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模板不包含快照。之后可以用这个模板新建虚拟机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Socket path is too long: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "socket 路径过长：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some settings take effect after you restart the guest" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "部分设置要重启客户机后生效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound or microphone settings changed after startup, so the suspended virtual machine can't resume. Shut it down; it'll use the new settings the next time it starts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开机后改过声音或麦克风设置，挂起的虚拟机无法继续运行。请将它关机，下次开机时会使用新设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound will be turned off at the next startup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下次开机时关闭声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound will be turned on at the next startup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下次开机时打开声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound: Off (takes effect at next startup)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "声音：关（下次开机生效）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound: On (takes effect at next startup)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "声音：开（下次开机生效）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Source" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "来源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start a VM in the background and wait until it's running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在后台启动虚拟机，启动完成后返回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start in recovery mode (macOS guests)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以恢复模式启动（macOS 客户机）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting for the first time to set up SSH and the guest agent…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在首次开机并配置 SSH 与客户机代理…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting in recovery mode; the suspended state won't be restored" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以恢复模式启动，不会恢复挂起的状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting the VM for the first time to set up SSH (this can take a few minutes)…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在首次开机以配置 SSH（可能需要几分钟）…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在启动…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starts the VM in the background if it isn't running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机未运行时自动在后台启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starts the VM in the background if it isn't running. A VM that was shut down or powered off stays off; start it with macvm start first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机未运行时自动在后台启动。已关机或已强制断电的虚拟机保持关闭，请先用 macvm start 开机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starts the VM in the background if it isn't running. Examples:\n  macvm exec dev -- uname -a\n  macvm exec dev -t --cwd \"$PWD\" -- claude" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机未运行时自动在后台启动。示例：\n  macvm exec dev -- uname -a\n  macvm exec dev -t --cwd \"$PWD\" -- claude"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Still waiting for %@ to shut down" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仍在等待 %@ 关机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suspend" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "挂起"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suspend a VM, saving its memory to disk so the next start resumes where it left off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "挂起虚拟机：把内存状态存盘后停止，下次 start 从此处继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suspend and Quit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "挂起并退出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suspended" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已挂起"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suspended. To make changes, resume it and then shut it down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已挂起。要修改设置，请先继续运行，再关机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suspending saves the current state of %@ so the next start picks up where it left off. %@ can't be suspended and will shut down normally." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Suspending saves the current state of %1$@ so the next start picks up where it left off. %2$@ can't be suspended and will shut down normally."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "挂起会保存 %@ 的当前状态，下次开机时接着运行。%@ 不能挂起，会正常关机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suspending saves the current state so the next start picks up where it left off. Shutting down waits for the guest to shut down on its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "挂起会保存当前状态，下次开机时接着运行。关机则要等客户机自行关机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suspending…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在挂起…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync Clipboard" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同步剪贴板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync the text clipboard: on or off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同步文本剪贴板：on 或 off。"
