    "Updating the guest agent…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在更新客户机代理…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use full Retina resolution in the app's window (QEMU engine and Linux on VZ): on or off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 App 窗口中使用完整 Retina 分辨率（QEMU 引擎与 VZ 下的 Linux）：on 或 off。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User Name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User name must be 1–20 lowercase letters, digits, _ . or -, starting with a letter or _: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用户名须为 1–20 个小写字母、数字或 _ . -，且以字母或 _ 开头：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses screen pixels instead of points for the window resolution, for a sharper image. On a Retina display, everything looks half as big, so set scaling to 200% in the guest. Takes effect right away, even while running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "窗口分辨率按屏幕像素而不是点计算，画面更清晰。在 Retina 显示屏上界面会缩小一半，请在客户机里把缩放设为 200%。运行时切换也立即生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses screen pixels instead of points for the window resolution, for a sharper image. The guest agent adjusts GNOME scaling to match. Takes effect right away, even while running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "窗口分辨率按屏幕像素而不是点计算，画面更清晰。客户机代理会相应调整 GNOME 的缩放。运行时切换也立即生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses screen pixels instead of points for the window resolution, for a sharper image. Windows adjusts its scaling to match. Takes effect right away, even while running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "窗口分辨率按屏幕像素而不是点计算，画面更清晰。Windows 会相应调整缩放。运行时切换也立即生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VM folder: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机目录：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VM is already running" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机已在运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VM is not running" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机未运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VM name (letters, digits, . _ -, up to 40 characters)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机名称（字母、数字、. _ -，最多 40 个字符）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VM name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VM not found" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机不存在"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VM stopped: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机已停止：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VM to clone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要克隆的虚拟机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VZ (lower overhead)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VZ（开销更低）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Value for set-value." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "set-value 要设的值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vertical scroll steps; positive values scroll down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "垂直滚动的格数，正值向下滚动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtual Machine" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtual Machines" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtual machine is already running: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机已在运行：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtual machine isn't running: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机未运行：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtual machine not found: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机不存在：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtual machines created from a template get a new machine identifier and MAC address. Deleting a template doesn't affect virtual machines created from it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从模板新建的虚拟机会获得新的机器标识与 MAC 地址。删除模板不影响由它新建的虚拟机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtual machines created from it aren't affected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由它新建的虚拟机不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtualization engine: vz (default, lowest overhead) or qemu (more features). Windows always installs with qemu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟化引擎：vz（默认，开销最低）或 qemu（功能更多）。Windows 总是用 qemu 安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtualization engine: vz or qemu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟化引擎：vz 或 qemu。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtualization.framework error" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Virtualization.framework 错误"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait until a VM is ready: its guest agent responds, or, without an agent, its SSH port accepts connections." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待虚拟机就绪：客户机代理有响应；没有代理时，SSH 端口能接受连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval in System Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在等待在系统设置中允许"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While running, only macOS guests started in this app can change shared folders. For other virtual machines, shut down first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运行时只有在本 App 中启动的 macOS 客户机可以修改共享目录。其他虚拟机请先关机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows Guests" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 客户机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows accepts only one --iso" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 只接受一个 --iso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows downloads in your preferred system language. If Microsoft blocks the download, which often happens after several downloads from the same network in a short time or over a VPN or proxy, try again in a few hours. You can also choose a local ISO and click Download from Microsoft… to download it in your browser (choose a language, then click Download); MacVM selects it when the download finishes. Windows then installs unattended with QEMU in about 15 minutes, with progress shown in the virtual machine window. Afterward, you can switch to the VZ engine in the virtual machine's settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 会以系统首选语言下载。如果微软阻止下载（同一网络短时间内下载多次，或使用 VPN、代理时常会这样），请过几个小时再试。你也可以选择本地 ISO，点按「从微软下载…」在浏览器里下载（选择语言后点按 Download），下载完成后 MacVM 会自动选中它。随后 Windows 会用 QEMU 无人值守安装，约需 15 分钟，进度显示在虚拟机窗口中。安装完成后，可以在虚拟机的设置里切换到 VZ 引擎。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows installation timed out" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 安装超时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows is ready: macvm exec %@ -- whoami (password in %@)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Windows is ready: macvm exec %1$@ -- whoami (password in %2$@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 已就绪：macvm exec %@ -- whoami（密码在 %@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows must be installed with NAT networking; change it afterward with macvm set --network" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 必须用 NAT 网络安装，装好后可用 macvm set --network 修改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows needs PMU emulation, which Virtualization.framework doesn't provide on this version of macOS" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows 需要 PMU 模拟，而当前版本 macOS 的 Virtualization.framework 不提供"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows: create the VM but don't start installing yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows：只创建虚拟机，暂不开始安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows: product key to activate online after installation; it isn't saved in the VM configuration. If omitted, Windows isn't activated." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows：产品密钥，安装后联网激活；不会保存到虚拟机配置中。省略时不激活 Windows。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows: virtio-win driver ISO; downloaded and cached if omitted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Windows：virtio-win 驱动 ISO，省略时下载并缓存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With NAT networking, the QEMU engine only forwards guest ports %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 NAT 网络时，QEMU 引擎只转发客户机端口 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With the vz engine, Windows runs at a fixed %lldx%lld and scales with the window; switch to the qemu engine for other resolutions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "With the vz engine, Windows runs at a fixed %1$lldx%2$lld and scales with the window; switch to the qemu engine for other resolutions"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 vz 引擎时，Windows 以固定的 %lldx%lld 分辨率运行，画面随窗口缩放；需要其他分辨率请换用 qemu 引擎"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working directory in the guest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "客户机中的工作目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works through the guest agent; SSH isn't needed. The agent is replaced first (it restarts once), then any setup the installer has gained since the VM was created is applied, such as Windows virtio drivers.\nSome settings take effect only after the guest restarts; add --reboot to restart it right away. Updating the Windows 3D graphics driver always restarts the guest. Use --check to list pending updates without applying them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过客户机代理完成，不需要 SSH。先替换代理（代理会重启一次），再应用虚拟机创建之后安装流程新增的设置，如 Windows 的 virtio 驱动。\n有些设置要在客户机重启后才生效，加 --reboot 可立即重启。更新 Windows 3D 显卡驱动时总会重启客户机。用 --check 只列出待做的更新，不应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write guest paths as <vm>:<absolute path>, for either the sources or the destination but not both. The destination must be an existing directory; if a name is already taken there, a number is appended (a.txt → a 2.txt).\nTo copy a local path that contains a colon, write it as ./a:b. Starts the VM in the background if it isn't running. Examples:\n  macvm cp report.pdf src dev:/home/me\n  macvm cp 'win:C:\\Users\\me\\Desktop\\a.txt' ." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "客户机路径写成 <虚拟机>:<绝对路径>，可用于来源或目标，但不能两者都是。目标必须是已存在的目录；如果其中已有同名项，会在名称后加编号（a.txt → a 2.txt）。\n要复制含冒号的本地路径，请写成 ./a:b。虚拟机未运行时自动在后台启动。示例：\n  macvm cp report.pdf src dev:/home/me\n  macvm cp 'win:C:\\Users\\me\\Desktop\\a.txt' ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write the guest console output to run.log when running in the background." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "后台运行时把客户机控制台输出写进 run.log。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes the config to ~/.config/macvm/ssh_config; from then on, macvm create and macvm rm keep it up to date.\nWith --install, also adds an Include line to the top of ~/.ssh/config so that ssh and other tools that read it (such as runode) can find these hosts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把配置写到 ~/.config/macvm/ssh_config，之后 macvm create 和 macvm rm 会自动更新它。\n加 --install 时，还会在 ~/.ssh/config 开头加一行 Include，让 ssh 和其他读取该文件的工具（如 runode）能找到这些主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrote %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已写入 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also open %@ in a browser and download the ISO manually." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "也可以在浏览器中打开 %@ 手动下载 ISO。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac user name, %@, can't be used in the guest. Enter a different user name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Mac 用户名 %@ 不能在客户机中使用。请输入其他用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your host user name %@ can't be used as the guest login user; choose one with --user" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主机用户名 %@ 不能用作客户机登录用户，请用 --user 另选一个"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a file is larger than its entry says" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件内容超出了条目记录的大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "config.json version %lld is newer than this version of MacVM supports (%lld)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "config.json version %1$lld is newer than this version of MacVM supports (%2$lld)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "config.json 的版本 %lld 高于当前 MacVM 支持的版本（%lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "core" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "核"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cores" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "核"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cp needs the guest agent, which isn't installed on %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "cp 要经客户机代理，%@ 未安装代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "disk only" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅磁盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "exit code %d" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退出码 %d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "first available interface" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一个可用的网卡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "got a data frame before any file entry" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收到文件条目前就收到了数据帧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "guest port %u isn't ready" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "客户机端口 %u 未就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "invalid path %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无效路径 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "macOS %@, %lld performance cores, %@ of memory" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS %1$@, %2$lld performance cores, %3$@ of memory"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS %@，%lld 个性能核，内存 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS guests can only use the vz engine" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 客户机只能用 vz 引擎"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS installs without shared folders; add them afterward with macvm set --add-share" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 安装时不能带共享目录，装好后可用 macvm set --add-share 添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS is ready: macvm ssh %@ (user %@, password in %@)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS is ready: macvm ssh %1$@ (user %2$@, password in %3$@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 已就绪：macvm ssh %@（用户 %@，密码在 %@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS must be installed with NAT networking; change it afterward with macvm set --network" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 必须用 NAT 网络安装，装好后可用 macvm set --network 修改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS on this Mac is too old to install %@ (%@)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS on this Mac is too old to install %1$@ (%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本机的 macOS 版本过旧，无法安装 %@（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS: display resolution (default 1920x1200)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS：显示分辨率，默认 1920x1200。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS: don't run macvm tune after setup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS：设置完成后不运行 macvm tune。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS: installs from an IPSW. Without --ipsw, downloads the latest version this Mac supports (about 15–20 GB, cached under ipsw in the downloads folder). On first boot it creates a user,\nturns on automatic login and SSH, installs the macvm SSH key and the guest agent, sets the hostname to the VM name, and runs every macvm tune step (skip with --no-tune).\n  macvm create mac --os macos\nWindows 11 ARM64: installs unattended from an official ISO using the QEMU engine (requires brew install qemu) and sets up a user and OpenSSH.\n  macvm create win --os windows --iso ~/Downloads/Win11_arm64.iso\nLinux cloud images (recommended): pick one with --image; it's downloaded and cached on first use. The VM boots with a user and the macvm SSH key already set up.\n  macvm create dev --image debian-13 --memory 8G\nLinux desktop: --desktop downloads the distribution's desktop installer ISO (checked with SHA-256 and cached). Ubuntu installs offline and unattended by default, with a user and the SSH public key set up;\nadd --manual-install to use the graphical installer instead. Fedora boots into the graphical installer in the window, where you finish the setup.\n  macvm create desk --desktop ubuntu-desktop\nInstallation media: creates an empty disk and boots the installer from the media given with --iso (Linux, Windows).\n  macvm create box --os linux --iso ~/Downloads/fedora-aarch64.iso\nTemplates: copies a template saved with macvm template save (any OS, including macOS). You can also pass --cpus, --memory, --disk (grow only), --network, and --engine.\n  macvm create dev2 --template dev-base" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS：从 IPSW 安装，不给 --ipsw 时下载本机支持的最新版本（约 15–20 GB，缓存在下载目录的 ipsw 下）。装好后首次开机自动创建用户、\n自动登录并开启 SSH，装入 macvm 专用密钥与客户机代理、把主机名设为虚拟机名，再执行 macvm tune 的全部项（--no-tune 跳过）。\n  macvm create mac --os macos\nWindows 11 ARM64：用 QEMU 引擎（需 brew install qemu）从原版 ISO 无人值守安装，装好即带用户与 OpenSSH。\n  macvm create win --os windows --iso ~/Downloads/Win11_arm64.iso\nLinux 云镜像（推荐）：--image 指定镜像，首次使用时下载并缓存；开机即带用户与 macvm 专用 SSH 密钥。\n  macvm create dev --image debian-13 --memory 8G\nLinux 桌面版：--desktop 下载发行方的桌面版安装 ISO（校验 SHA-256 并缓存）。Ubuntu 默认离线无人值守安装，装好即带用户与 SSH 公钥，\n加 --manual-install 改为图形安装；Fedora 开机后在窗口里完成图形安装。\n  macvm create desk --desktop ubuntu-desktop\n安装介质：创建空磁盘，从 --iso 指定的介质启动安装（Linux、Windows）。\n  macvm create box --os linux --iso ~/Downloads/fedora-aarch64.iso\n模板：复制 macvm template save 存下的模板（任何系统，含 macOS），可另指定 --cpus、--memory、--disk（只能扩大）、--network、--engine。\n  macvm create dev2 --template dev-base"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS: local IPSW file (default: download the latest version this Mac supports)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS：本地 IPSW 文件，省略时下载本机支持的最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS: skip the first boot that sets up SSH, the guest agent, and tuning." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS：跳过首次开机时的 SSH、客户机代理与调优设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macvm doesn't know the login user for %@ (for VMs installed from installation media, set up SSH yourself)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macvm 不知道 %@ 的登录用户（用安装介质安装的虚拟机请自行配置 SSH）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "no output" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无输出"
          }
        }
      }
